          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The limit is held by macOS itself, so it keeps working while the Mac sleeps, after a restart and when Keel is closed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Limit hält macOS selbst, also wirkt es im Ruhezustand, nach einem Neustart und bei geschlossenem Keel."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El límite lo mantiene el propio macOS, así que sigue funcionando en reposo, tras reiniciar y con Keel cerrado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La limite est tenue par macOS lui-même : elle fonctionne en veille, après un redémarrage et Keel fermé."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O limite é mantido pelo próprio macOS, por isso continua a funcionar com o Mac a dormir, após reiniciar e com o Keel fechado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS energy mode. High Power only exists on some MacBook Pro models.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
